@namespace Lumeo.Docs.Shared.Showcases
@* Static exception (see ../README.md): FileViewer detects the file kind and, for PDF/code
   kinds, delegates to PdfViewer/CodeEditor — both external-engine, network-backed viewers
   that can't render offline under bUnit. This renders the exact header bar (file icon, name,
   kind label, download button — same classes as FileViewer's own) above a centered file-icon
   body, matching what an unresolved/unsupported preview looks like. *@

<div class="w-full max-w-[22rem] h-36 rounded-lg border border-border/40 overflow-hidden flex flex-col">
    <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-2 border-b border-border/40 bg-background/60 px-3 py-2 shrink-0">
        <div class="flex min-w-0 items-center gap-2">
            <span class="shrink-0 text-muted-foreground"><DynamicIcon Name="FileText" Class="h-4 w-4" /></span>
            <span class="truncate text-xs text-foreground">quarterly-report.pdf</span>
            <span class="text-xs text-muted-foreground">PDF</span>
        </div>
        <span class="inline-flex h-6 w-6 items-center justify-center rounded-md text-muted-foreground">
            <DynamicIcon Name="Download" Class="h-3.5 w-3.5" />
        </span>
    </div>
    <div class="flex-1 flex items-center justify-center bg-background">
        <DynamicIcon Name="FileText" Class="h-9 w-9 text-muted-foreground" />
    </div>
</div>
